      "Underground parking"
    ],
    "coverageToMatch": {
      "note": "The 5 Year New Vehicle Protection runs 60 months from delivery and replaces the car with a new current-year equivalent on a total loss. Most brokers quote OPCF 43R instead, a limited depreciation waiver usually capped at 24 to 30 months. A cheaper quote carrying plain 43R is a downgrade, not a saving.",
